          "_name": "content4",
          "_sourceTheme": "mobirise5",
          "_customHTML": "<section data-bs-version=\"5.1\" class=\"content4\" group=\"Content\" data-bg-video=\"{{bg.type == 'video'&&bg.value.url}}\" mbr-class=\"{\n    'mbr-fullscreen': fullScreen,\n    'mbr-parallax-background': bg.parallax}\">\n    <mbr-parameters>\n        <header>Size</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Screen\" name=\"fullScreen\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Width\" name=\"fullWidth\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Top\" name=\"paddingTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"1\" condition=\"fullScreen == false\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Bottom\" name=\"paddingBottom\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"0\" condition=\"fullScreen == false\">\n        <input type=\"range\" name=\"textWidth\" title=\"Width\" min=\"4\" max=\"12\" step=\"1\" value=\"10\">\n        <header>Show/Hide</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Title\" name=\"showTitle\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Subtitle\" name=\"showSubtitle\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Buttons\" name=\"showButtons\">\n        <header>Background</header>\n        <fieldset type=\"background\" name=\"bg\" parallax>\n            <input type=\"image\" title=\"Image\" value=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/background1.jpg\">\n            <input type=\"color\" title=\"Color\" value=\"#ffffff\" selected>\n            <input type=\"video\" title=\"Video\" value=\"https://vimeo.com/428046504\">\n        </fieldset>\n        <header condition=\"bg.type === 'video'\">Fallback Image</header>\n        <input type=\"image\" title=\"Fallback Image\" value=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/background13.jpg\" name=\"fallBackImage\" condition=\"bg.type === 'video'\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Overlay\" name=\"overlay\" condition=\"bg.type !== 'color'\" checked>\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Overlay Color\" name=\"overlayColor\" value=\"#ffffff\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Opacity\" name=\"overlayOpacity\" min=\"0\" max=\"1\" step=\"0.1\" value=\"0.7\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n    </mbr-parameters>\n\n    <div class=\"mbr-fallback-image disabled\" mbr-if=\"bg.type == 'video'\"></div>\n    <div class=\"mbr-overlay\" mbr-if=\"overlay && bg.type!== 'color'\" mbr-style=\"{'opacity': overlayOpacity, 'background-color': overlayColor}\">\n    </div>\n    <div mbr-class=\"{'container': !fullWidth, 'container-fluid': fullWidth}\">\n        <div class=\"row justify-content-center\">\n            <div class=\"title col-md-12 col-lg-{{textWidth}}\">\n                <h3 class=\"mbr-section-title mbr-fonts-style align-center mb-4\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-title\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-2\"><b>How GlucoFlush Works?\n</b><div><b><br></b></div></h3>\n                <h4 class=\"mbr-section-subtitle align-center mbr-fonts-style mb-4\" mbr-if=\"showSubtitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-subtitle\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\"><div><b>1. Nutritional Support for the Retina:</b>&nbsp;VISIVRA works through a combination of nutrients that support different aspects of normal eye function. The retina is a light-sensitive layer located at the back of the eye, and it plays an essential role in processing the images we see. It requires a steady supply of nutrients to maintain its normal function. VISIVRA contains Lutein, Zeaxanthin, Zinc, and Vitamin A, which are associated with retinal and visual health. These nutrients help provide nutritional support for the structures involved in seeing. Rather than working like prescription eye drops or corrective lenses, the formula focuses on supplying nutrients that contribute to normal visual function.</div><div><br></div><div><b>2. Supporting Macular Health:</b>&nbsp;The macula is a small but important area of the retina responsible for detailed central vision. Lutein and Zeaxanthin are two carotenoids naturally concentrated in this region. They contribute to the macular pigment, which helps filter certain wavelengths of light and provides antioxidant protection. VISIVRA includes both nutrients as part of its eye-support formula. Regular dietary intake of these carotenoids is relevant to maintaining healthy macular nutrition. Their role is one reason they are frequently included in nutritional products designed for eye wellness. However, taking a supplement does not guarantee improved eyesight or prevent every age-related eye condition.</div><div><br></div><div><b>3. Antioxidant Protection:</b>&nbsp;Everyday activities and normal metabolic processes can expose body tissues to oxidative stress. The eyes are no exception, as they are constantly exposed to light and environmental factors. VISIVRA includes Bilberry Extract and Astaxanthin, ingredients known for their antioxidant properties. Antioxidants help the body manage free radicals, which are unstable molecules that can affect cells when present in excessive amounts. These ingredients are included to complement the other nutrients in the formula and support general eye wellness. Their presence makes VISIVRA a combination of carotenoids, antioxidants, vitamins, and minerals rather than a formula focused on only one nutrient.</div><div><br></div><div><b>4. Supporting Normal Visual Function: </b>Vitamin A and Zinc are important nutrients involved in normal visual function. Vitamin A contributes to the visual cycle, the process through which the eyes respond to changes in light. Zinc also plays a role in normal vitamin A metabolism and supports several important biological processes. VISIVRA brings these two nutrients together with Lutein, Zeaxanthin, and other ingredients to provide broader nutritional support. Getting sufficient amounts of essential nutrients is important for maintaining normal body functions. The formula may complement a balanced diet, although it cannot compensate for every nutritional deficiency or replace medical advice when someone experiences changes in their vision.</div><div><b><br></b></div><div><b>5. Consistent Daily Nutritional Support: </b>VISIVRA is intended to fit into a regular wellness routine rather than provide an immediate effect. Nutritional supplements generally work by adding selected nutrients to the diet, and their usefulness depends on individual nutritional needs, overall health, and consistency of use. The carotenoids and other ingredients in VISIVRA are included to support different aspects of eye nutrition. People should follow the instructions printed on the actual product label and avoid taking more than the recommended amount. Along with appropriate screen habits, a balanced diet, and regular eye examinations, this approach can help people take a more thoughtful and consistent approach to maintaining their eye health.</div><div>\n</div><div>\n</div><div>\n</div><div>\n</div><div>\n</div><div>\n</div><div>\n</div><div><b>\n</b></div><div>\n</div><div>\n</div><div>\n</div></h4>\n                <div class=\"mbr-section-btn align-center\" mbr-if=\"showButtons\" mbr-buttons mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\">\n                    <a class=\"btn btn-primary\" href=\"https://mobiri.se\">LEARN MORE</a>\n                    <a class=\"btn btn-primary-outline\" href=\"https://mobiri.se\">LIVE DEMO</a>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</section>",
          "_anchor": "content4-2n",
          "_isUserblock": true,
          "_cid": "vawa0RkZCS",
          "_protectedParams": [],
          "_global": false,
          "_once": false,
          "_params": {}
        },
        {
          "alias": false,
          "_styles": {
            "& when not (@fullScreen)": {
              "padding-top": "(@paddingTop * 1rem)",
              "padding-bottom": "(@paddingBottom * 1rem)"
            },
            "& when (@bg-type = 'image')": {
              "background-image": "url(@bg-value)"
            },
            "& when (@bg-type = 'color')": {
              "background-color": "@bg-value"
            },
            ".mbr-fallback-image.disabled": {
              "display": "none"
            },
            ".mbr-fallback-image": {
              "display": "block",
              "background-size": "cover",
              "background-position": "center center",
              "width": "100%",
              "height": "100%",
              "position": "absolute",
              "top": "0",
              "& when (@bg-type = 'video')": {
                "background-image": "url(@fallBackImage)"
              }
            },
            ".mbr-section-subtitle": {
              "color": "#ffffff"
            }
          },
          "_name": "header3",
          "_sourceTheme": "mobirise5",
          "_customHTML": "<section data-bs-version=\"5.1\" class=\"header3\" group=\"Headers\" data-bg-video=\"{{bg.type == 'video' && bg.value.url}}\" mbr-class=\"{\n    'mbr-fullscreen': fullScreen,\n    'mbr-parallax-background': bg.parallax}\">\n\n    <mbr-parameters>\n        <header>Size</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Screen\" name=\"fullScreen\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Width\" name=\"fullWidth\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Top\" name=\"paddingTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"2\" condition=\"fullScreen == false\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Bottom\" name=\"paddingBottom\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"0\" condition=\"fullScreen == false\">\n\n        <input type=\"range\" inline name=\"textWidth\" title=\"Width\" min=\"4\" max=\"12\" value=\"12\" step=\"1\">\n        <select title=\"Align\" name=\"contentAlign\">\n            <option value>Left</option>\n            <option value=\"justify-content-center\" selected>Center</option>\n            <option value=\"justify-content-end\">Right</option>\n        </select>\n        <header>Show/Hide</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Title\" name=\"showTitle\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Subtitle\" name=\"showSubitle\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Text\" name=\"showText\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Buttons\" name=\"showButtons\">\n        <header>Background</header>\n        <fieldset type=\"background\" name=\"bg\" parallax>\n            <input type=\"image\" title=\"Image\" value=\"../_images/background11.jpg\">\n            <input type=\"color\" title=\"Color\" value=\"#00245c\" selected>\n            <input type=\"video\" title=\"Video\" value=\"https://vimeo.com/428046504\">\n        </fieldset>\n        <header condition=\"bg.type === 'video'\">Fallback Image</header>\n        <input type=\"image\" title=\"Fallback Image\" value=\"../_images/background13.jpg\" name=\"fallBackImage\" condition=\"bg.type === 'video'\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Overlay\" name=\"overlay\" condition=\"bg.type !== 'color'\" checked>\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Overlay Color\" name=\"overlayColor\" value=\"#ffffff\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Opacity\" name=\"overlayOpacity\" min=\"0\" max=\"1\" step=\"0.1\" value=\"0.2\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n    </mbr-parameters>\n\n    <div class=\"mbr-fallback-image disabled\" mbr-if=\"bg.type == 'video'\"></div>\n    <div class=\"mbr-overlay\" mbr-if=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\" opacity=\"{{overlayOpacity}}\" bg-color=\"{{overlayColor}}\"></div>\n\n    <div class=\"align-center\" mbr-class=\"{'container': !fullWidth, 'container-fluid': fullWidth}\">\n        <div class=\"row {{contentAlign}}\">\n            <div class=\"col-12 col-lg-{{textWidth}}\">\n                <h1 class=\"mbr-section-title mbr-fonts-style mb-3\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-title\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-1\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\"><b>Building a website</b></h1>\n                <h2 class=\"mbr-section-subtitle mbr-fonts-style mb-3\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-subtitle\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-2\" mbr-if=\"showSubitle\"><b>VISIVRA Customer Reviews</b></h2>\n                <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showText\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text, .mbr-section-btn\">For fast prototyping and small customers' projects.</p>\n                <div mbr-buttons mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" class=\"mbr-section-btn mt-3\" mbr-if=\"showButtons\"><a class=\"btn btn-success\" href=\"https://mobiri.se\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\">Free Download!</a></div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</section>",
          "_anchor": "header3-28",
          "_cid": "v9ZkBNkyiK",
          "_protectedParams": [],
          "_global": false,
          "_once": false,
          "_params": {}
        },
        {
          "alias": false,
          "_styles": {
            "padding-top": "(@paddingTop * 1rem)",
            "padding-bottom": "(@paddingBottom * 1rem)",
            "& when (@bg-type = \"color\")": {
              "background-color": "@bg-value"
            },
            "& when (@bg-type = \"image\")": {
              "background-image": "url(@bg-value)"
            },
            ".mbr-fallback-image.disabled": {
              "display": "none"
            },
            ".mbr-fallback-image": {
              "display": "block",
              "background-size": "cover",
              "background-position": "center center",
              "width": "100%",
              "height": "100%",
              "position": "absolute",
              "top": "0",
              "& when (@bg-type = 'video')": {
                "background-image": "url(@fallBackImage)"
              }
            },
            ".item:not(:nth-last-child(1))": {
              "margin-bottom": "2rem"
            },
            ".item-wrapper": {
              "background-color": "@cardBg",
              "border-radius": "4px",
              "& when (@transparentCard)": {
                "background-color": "transparent"
              }
            },
            ".image-wrapper img": {
              "width": "100%",
              "object-fit": "cover"
            },
            ".social-row": {
              ".soc-item": {
                "display": "inline-block",
                "text-align": "center",
                "border-radius": "50%",
                "margin-right": "0.6rem",
                "margin-bottom": "1rem",
                "padding": "0.5rem",
                "border": "2px solid @socialIconColor",
                "transition": "all 0.3s",
                ".mbr-iconfont": {
                  "display": "flex",
                  "justify-content": "center",
                  "align-content": "center",
                  "color": "@socialIconColor",
                  "font-size": "1.5rem",
                  "transition": "all 0.3s"
                },
                "&:hover": {
                  "background-color": "@socialIconColor",
                  ".mbr-iconfont": {
                    "color": "contrast(@socialIconColor)"
                  }
                }
              }
            },
            "@media (max-width: 767px)": {
              ".card-box": {
                "padding": "1rem"
              }
            },
            "@media (min-width: 768px)": {
              ".card-box": {
                "padding-right": "2rem"
              }
            },
            "@media (min-width: 992px)": {
              ".card-box": {
                "padding-left": "2rem",
                "padding-right": "4rem"
              }
            },
            ".card-subtitle": {
              "color": "#1a9950"
            },
            ".card-title": {
              "color": "#000000"
            }
          },
          "_name": "team2",
          "_sourceTheme": "mobirise5",
          "_customHTML": "<section data-bs-version=\"5.1\" class=\"team2\" group=\"Team\" data-bg-video=\"{{bg.type == 'video' && bg.value.url}}\" mbr-class=\"{'mbr-parallax-background': bg.parallax}\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/html\">\n    <mbr-parameters>\n        <header>Size</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"fullWidth\" title=\"Full Width\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Top\" name=\"paddingTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"2\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Bottom\" name=\"paddingBottom\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"6\">\n        <input type=\"range\" name=\"imageWidth\" title=\"Image\" min=\"2\" max=\"6\" step=\"1\" value=\"2\">\n        <header>Show/Hide</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Title\" name=\"showTitle\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Subitle\" name=\"showSubtitle\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Text\" name=\"showText\" checked>\n        <header>Card</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Transparent\" name=\"transparentCard\">\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Color\" name=\"cardBg\" value=\"#ffffff\" condition=\"!transparentCard\">\n        <select title=\"Amount\" name=\"cardsAmount\">\n            <option value=\"1\">1</option>\n            <option value=\"2\" selected>2</option>\n            <option value=\"3\">3</option>\n        </select>\n        <header condition=\"showSocial\">Social</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Social\" name=\"showSocial\">\n        <input type=\"range\" name=\"socialCount\" title=\"Count\" min=\"1\" max=\"5\" step=\"1\" value=\"3\" condition=\"showSocial\">\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Color\" name=\"socialIconColor\" value=\"#6592e6\" condition=\"showSocial\">\n        <header>Background</header>\n        <fieldset type=\"background\" name=\"bg\" parallax>\n            <input type=\"image\" title=\"Image\" value=\"../_images/background1.jpg\">\n            <input type=\"color\" title=\"Color\" value=\"#ffffff\" selected>\n            <input type=\"video\" title=\"Video\" value=\"https://vimeo.com/428046504\">\n        </fieldset>\n        <header condition=\"bg.type === 'video'\">Fallback Image</header>\n        <input type=\"image\" title=\"Fallback Image\" value=\"../_images/background13.jpg\" name=\"fallBackImage\" condition=\"bg.type === 'video'\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Overlay\" name=\"overlay\" checked condition=\"bg.type !== 'color'\">\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Overlay Color\" name=\"overlayColor\" value=\"#cebfaf\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Opacity\" name=\"overlayOpacity\" min=\"0\" max=\"1\" step=\"0.1\" value=\"0.5\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n    </mbr-parameters>\n\n    <div class=\"mbr-fallback-image disabled\" mbr-if=\"bg.type == 'video'\"></div>\n    <div class=\"mbr-overlay\" mbr-if=\"overlay && bg.type!== 'color'\" mbr-style=\"{'opacity': overlayOpacity, 'background-color': overlayColor}\">\n    </div>\n    <div mbr-class=\"{'container': !fullWidth}\">\n        <div class=\"item features-image\">\n            <div class=\"item-wrapper\">\n                <div class=\"row align-items-center\">\n                    <div class=\"col-12 col-md-{{imageWidth}}\">\n                        <div class=\"image-wrapper\">\n                            <img src=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/granny-close-375x353.jpg\" alt=\"Emily R., USA (Verified Purchase)\">\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"col-12 col-md\">\n                        <div class=\"card-box\">\n                            <h2 class=\"card-title mbr-fonts-style m-0 mb-3\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\" data-app-selector=\".card-title\"><b>Emily R., USA (Verified Purchase)</b></h2>\n                            <h2 class=\"card-subtitle mbr-fonts-style mb-3\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" mbr-if=\"showSubtitle\" data-app-selector=\".card-subtitle\"><b>⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐ Verified Purchase&nbsp;</b></h2>\n                            <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text, .social-row\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showText\">\"What I liked about VISIVRA was its focus on eye nutrition. I spend quite a bit of time reading and using my phone, so I wanted to learn more about ways to support my eye health. The ingredient combination looks interesting, and the capsule format is convenient for a daily routine. I also appreciate that I can review the ingredients and product information before making my decision.\"<br></p>\n                            <div class=\"social-row display-7\" mbr-if=\"showSocial\">\n                                <div class=\"soc-item\">\n                                    <a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/Mobirise/\" target=\"_blank\">\n                                        <span mbr-icon class=\"mbr-iconfont socicon socicon-facebook\"></span>\n                                    </a>\n                                </div>\n                                <div class=\"soc-item\" mbr-if=\"socialCount>1\">\n                                    <a href=\"https://twitter.com/mobirise\" target=\"_blank\">\n                                        <span mbr-icon class=\"mbr-iconfont socicon socicon-twitter\"></span>\n                                    </a>\n                                </div>\n                                <div class=\"soc-item\" mbr-if=\"socialCount>2\">\n                                    <a href=\"https://instagram.com/mobirise\" target=\"_blank\">\n                                        <span mbr-icon class=\"mbr-iconfont socicon socicon-instagram\"></span>\n                                    </a>\n                                </div>\n                                <div class=\"soc-item\" mbr-if=\"socialCount>3\">\n                                    <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/c/mobirise\" target=\"_blank\">\n                                        <span mbr-icon class=\"mbr-iconfont socicon socicon-youtube\"></span>\n                                    </a>\n                                </div>\n                                <div class=\"soc-item\" mbr-if=\"socialCount>4\">\n                                    <a href=\"https://twitter.com/mobirise\" target=\"_blank\">\n                                        <span mbr-icon class=\"mbr-iconfont socicon socicon-telegram\"></span>\n                                    </a>\n                                </div>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"item features-image\">\n            <div class=\"item-wrapper\">\n                <div class=\"row align-items-center\">\n                    <div class=\"col-12 col-md-{{imageWidth}}\">\n                        <div class=\"image-wrapper\">\n                            <img src=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/149e02d2-dc52-42ea-9e5e-cba019acffad-375x375.png\" alt=\"Sarah M., USA (Verified Purchase)\">\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"col-12 col-md\">\n                        <div class=\"card-box\">\n                            <h2 class=\"card-title mbr-fonts-style m-0 mb-3\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\" data-app-selector=\".card-title\"><b>Sarah M., USA (Verified Purchase)</b></h2>\n                            <h2 class=\"card-subtitle mbr-fonts-style mb-3\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" mbr-if=\"showSubtitle\" data-app-selector=\".card-subtitle\"><b>⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐ Verified Purchase&nbsp;</b></h2>\n                            <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text, .social-row\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showText\">\"I was looking for a supplement that could support my daily eye wellness, especially because I spend so much time working on my laptop. VISIVRA caught my attention because of its combination of ingredients like Lutein and Zeaxanthin. I like the simple capsule format and appreciate having all these nutrients together in one product. It is also a good reminder to take better care of my eyes every day.\"<br></p>\n                            <div class=\"social-row display-7\" mbr-if=\"showSocial\">\n                                <div class=\"soc-item\">\n                                    <a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/Mobirise/\" target=\"_blank\">\n                                        <span mbr-icon class=\"mbr-iconfont socicon socicon-facebook\"></span>\n                                    </a>\n                                </div>\n                                <div class=\"soc-item\" mbr-if=\"socialCount>1\">\n                                    <a href=\"https://twitter.com/mobirise\" target=\"_blank\">\n                                        <span mbr-icon class=\"mbr-iconfont socicon socicon-twitter\"></span>\n                                    </a>\n                                </div>\n                                <div class=\"soc-item\" mbr-if=\"socialCount>2\">\n                                    <a href=\"https://instagram.com/mobirise\" target=\"_blank\">\n                                        <span mbr-icon class=\"mbr-iconfont socicon socicon-instagram\"></span>\n                                    </a>\n                                </div>\n                                <div class=\"soc-item\" mbr-if=\"socialCount>3\">\n                                    <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/c/mobirise\" target=\"_blank\">\n                                        <span mbr-icon class=\"mbr-iconfont socicon socicon-youtube\"></span>\n                                    </a>\n                                </div>\n                                <div class=\"soc-item\" mbr-if=\"socialCount>4\">\n                                    <a href=\"https://twitter.com/mobirise\" target=\"_blank\">\n                                        <span mbr-icon class=\"mbr-iconfont socicon socicon-telegram\"></span>\n                                    </a>\n                                </div>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"item features-image\">\n            <div class=\"item-wrapper\">\n                <div class=\"row align-items-center\">\n                    <div class=\"col-12 col-md-{{imageWidth}}\">\n                        <div class=\"image-wrapper\">\n                            <img src=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/59ab6b2a-d36a-4dc1-866c-c922b58305f5-375x375.png\" alt=\"Michael T., USA (Verified Purchase)\">\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"col-12 col-md\">\n                        <div class=\"card-box\">\n                            <h2 class=\"card-title mbr-fonts-style m-0 mb-3\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\" data-app-selector=\".card-title\"><b>Michael T., USA (Verified Purchase)</b></h2>\n                            <h2 class=\"card-subtitle mbr-fonts-style mb-3\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" mbr-if=\"showSubtitle\" data-app-selector=\".card-subtitle\"><b>⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐ Verified Purchase&nbsp;</b></h2>\n                            <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text, .social-row\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showText\">\"I spend most of my working hours in front of a computer, so eye health is something I have started paying more attention to. I came across VISIVRA while looking for nutritional support for normal vision. I like that it contains a combination of vitamins, minerals, and plant-based ingredients. The product information is easy to understand, and I find the capsule format convenient.\"<br></p>\n                            <div class=\"social-row display-7\" mbr-if=\"showSocial\">\n                                <div class=\"soc-item\">\n                                    <a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/Mobirise/\" target=\"_blank\">\n                                        <span mbr-icon class=\"mbr-iconfont socicon socicon-facebook\"></span>\n                                    </a>\n                                </div>\n                                <div class=\"soc-item\" mbr-if=\"socialCount>1\">\n                                    <a href=\"https://twitter.com/mobirise\" target=\"_blank\">\n                                        <span mbr-icon class=\"mbr-iconfont socicon socicon-twitter\"></span>\n                                    </a>\n                                </div>\n                                <div class=\"soc-item\" mbr-if=\"socialCount>2\">\n                                    <a href=\"https://instagram.com/mobirise\" target=\"_blank\">\n                                        <span mbr-icon class=\"mbr-iconfont socicon socicon-instagram\"></span>\n                                    </a>\n                                </div>\n                                <div class=\"soc-item\" mbr-if=\"socialCount>3\">\n                                    <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/c/mobirise\" target=\"_blank\">\n                                        <span mbr-icon class=\"mbr-iconfont socicon socicon-youtube\"></span>\n                                    </a>\n                                </div>\n                                <div class=\"soc-item\" mbr-if=\"socialCount>4\">\n                                    <a href=\"https://twitter.com/mobirise\" target=\"_blank\">\n                                        <span mbr-icon class=\"mbr-iconfont socicon socicon-telegram\"></span>\n                                    </a>\n                                </div>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</section>",
