        {
          "alias": false,
          "_styles": {
            "padding-top": "(@paddingTop * 1rem)",
            "padding-bottom": "(@paddingBottom * 1rem)",
            "background-color": "@bgColor",
            ".counter-container": {
              "ul": {
                "margin": "0",
                "list-style": "none",
                "padding-left": "2.5rem",
                "li": {
                  "margin-bottom": "1rem",
                  "position": "relative",
                  "& when (@stylizedCounters)": {
                    "list-style": "none",
                    "position": "relative",
                    "padding-left": "1rem",
                    "&:before": {
                      "position": "absolute",
                      "left": "-40px",
                      "content": "\"\"",
                      "display": "flex",
                      "justify-content": "center",
                      "align-items": "center",
                      "color": "contrast(@iconColor)",
                      "background-color": "@iconColor",
                      "width": "40px",
                      "height": "40px",
                      "border-radius": "50%",
                      "margin-top": "5px",
                      "& when (@countersType = \"circle\")": {
                        "background": "none",
                        "border": "1px solid @iconColor",
                        "color": "@iconColor"
                      },
                      "& when (@countersType = \"square\")": {
                        "border-radius": "0"
                      },
                      "& when (@mark)": {
                        "content": "\"✓\""
                      }
                    }
                  },
                  "& when not (@stylizedCounters)": {
                    "&:before": {
                      "position": "absolute",
                      "left": "-1.6rem",
                      "content": "\"\\2022\"",
                      "color": "@iconColor",
                      "font-weight": "bold",
                      "font-size": "2rem",
                      "width": "1.6rem",
                      "line-height": "1.2"
                    }
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "_name": "content8",
          "_sourceTheme": "mobirise5",
          "_customHTML": "<section data-bs-version=\"5.1\" class=\"content8\" group=\"Content\">\n    <mbr-parameters>\n        <header>Size</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Width\" name=\"fullWidth\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Top\" name=\"paddingTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"0\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Bottom\" name=\"paddingBottom\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"3\">\n        <input type=\"range\" name=\"textWidth\" title=\"Width\" min=\"4\" max=\"12\" value=\"12\" step=\"1\">\n        <header>Show/Hide</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Title\" name=\"showTitle\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Stylized\" name=\"stylizedCounters\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Mark\" name=\"mark\" checked condition=\"stylizedCounters\">\n        <select title=\"Type\" name=\"countersType\" condition=\"stylizedCounters\">\n            <option value=\"default\" selected>Сircle Fill</option>\n            <option value=\"circle\">Circle</option>\n            <option value=\"square\">Square</option>\n        </select>\n        <input type=\"color\" name=\"iconColor\" title=\"Color\" value=\"#18356a\">\n        <header>Background</header>\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Color\" name=\"bgColor\" value=\"#ffffff\">\n    </mbr-parameters>\n    <div mbr-class=\"{'container': !fullWidth, 'container-fluid': fullWidth}\">\n        <div class=\"row justify-content-center\">\n            <div class=\"counter-container col-md-12 col-lg-{{textWidth}}\">\n                <h4 class=\"mbr-section-title mbr-fonts-style mb-4\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-title\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\">\n                    Shape your future web project with the Mobirise app.\n                </h4>\n                <div class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text\" data-multiline mbr-article>\n                    <div><b><br></b></div><ul>\n                        <li><b style=\"font-size: 1.4rem;\">Supports Healthy Vision: </b><span style=\"font-size: 1.4rem;\">One of the main reasons people consider VISIVRA is its focus on supporting normal vision. The formula contains Vitamin A and Zinc, two nutrients that contribute to normal visual function. Vitamin A plays an important role in the process that allows the eyes to respond to light, while Zinc supports normal vitamin A metabolism. These nutrients are important parts of a balanced nutritional routine. VISIVRA combines them with additional eye-support ingredients to provide a more focused formula. It may be useful for adults who want to pay closer attention to their daily eye nutrition. However, it does not correct refractive errors or replace prescription glasses.</span></li><li><b style=\"font-size: 1.4rem;\">Helps Maintain Macular Health:</b><span style=\"font-size: 1.4rem;\">&nbsp;The macula is responsible for central vision, which we use when reading, recognizing faces, and looking at fine details. VISIVRA contains Lutein and Zeaxanthin, two carotenoids that naturally accumulate in the macula. They contribute to the macular pigment and help provide antioxidant protection within this important area of the retina. Getting these nutrients through food or appropriate supplementation can be part of a broader eye health routine. Their inclusion makes the formula relevant to people interested in maintaining macular nutrition as they get older. VISIVRA is not a treatment for macular degeneration, and anyone with existing retinal problems should seek professional eye care.</span></li></ul><ul><li><span style=\"font-size: 1.4rem;\"><b>Provides Antioxidant Support: </b>Oxidative stress is a natural biological process that can affect cells and tissues throughout the body. The eyes also need protection against oxidative stress as part of their normal maintenance. VISIVRA contains Bilberry Extract and Astaxanthin, which are known for their antioxidant properties. These ingredients complement Lutein and Zeaxanthin, creating a combination of nutrients associated with eye wellness. Antioxidants are commonly included in nutritional supplements because they help the body manage free radicals. Adding antioxidant-rich foods to the diet can also be beneficial. VISIVRA offers another way to include selected antioxidant ingredients in a daily eye nutrition routine.</span></li><li><b>Supports Eye Comfort During Screen Use: </b>Many people spend hours looking at computers, smartphones, and tablets for work or entertainment. Extended screen use can contribute to temporary discomfort, tired eyes, and difficulty maintaining comfortable focus. VISIVRA is designed for people who want additional nutritional support as part of their eye care routine. Its ingredients are associated with retinal nutrition and antioxidant support, although the product should not be presented as a proven treatment for digital eye strain. Practical habits are equally important. Taking regular screen breaks, adjusting brightness, blinking frequently, and maintaining a comfortable viewing distance can help support eye comfort throughout the day.</li><li><b>Supports Overall Eye Wellness: </b>Eye health involves more than simply being able to see clearly. It also includes maintaining healthy eye tissues, normal visual function, and good nutritional status. VISIVRA brings together six ingredients selected for their connection with eye nutrition and antioxidant support. This combination may appeal to adults who want a convenient way to include targeted nutrients in their daily routine. It can complement other healthy habits, such as eating a balanced diet, staying hydrated, managing screen time, and attending regular eye examinations. Taking a broader approach to wellness is more useful than depending on a single supplement to solve every eye-related concern.</li><li><b style=\"font-size: 1.4rem;\">Provides Nutritional Support for Retinal Wellness: </b><span style=\"font-size: 1.4rem;\">The retina contains specialized cells that help convert light into signals sent to the brain. Maintaining healthy retinal function is therefore an important part of overall eye health. VISIVRA includes several nutrients associated with retinal nutrition, including Lutein, Zeaxanthin, Vitamin A, and Zinc. Its formula also contains antioxidant ingredients that complement this nutritional approach. For adults interested in maintaining their eye health, these nutrients can be considered alongside a varied diet containing leafy green vegetables, colorful fruits, and other nutritious foods. VISIVRA is a dietary supplement, not a medicine, and it should not be used to treat retinal diseases.</span></li></ul><ul>\n                    </ul>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</section>",
